>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Single-point calculation on the original coordinates and ligand-by-ligand Lewis review. The two oxalate carbons in the input are separated by 3.188 Å. Two electronic-structure calculations at fixed coordinates reproduce the four strong C–O bonds. Use the donor limiting form with two neutral CO₂ ligands and Co(I); The bending angles, partial charges and calculated spin populations of both fragments are recorded separately. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

